bution, add iframe.html as an entry.\\n      // In development mode, it's not an entry - instead, we use a middleware\\n      // to serve iframe.html. The reason is that Vite's dev server (at the time of writing)\\n      // does not support virtual files as entry points.\",\n            \"end_line\": 43,\n            \"path\": \"code/builders/builder-vite/src/plugins/code-generator-plugin.ts\",\n            \"score\": 80,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-cb353ca120a0\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"key-source\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-1379db2c3f3d\",\n            \"start_line\": 20,\n            \"symbol_ids\": [\n              \"symbol-2b26413209e1\"\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"content\": \"async configureServer(server) {\\n      (await storyIndexGeneratorPromise).onInvalidated(() => {\\n        // TODO: this is only necessary when new files are added.\\n        // Changes and removals are already watched and handled by Vite, so they actually trigger a double HMR event right now.\\n        server.watcher.emit(\\n          'change',\\n          getResolvedVirtualModuleId(SB_VIRTUAL_FILES.VIRTUAL_STORIES_FILE)\\n        );\\n      });\\n    },\",\n            \"end_line\": 38,\n            \"path\": \"code/builders/builder-vite/src/plugins/code-generator-plugin.ts\",\n            \"score\": 80,\n            \"snippet_id\": \"snippet-0d08f8dd19f7\",\n            \"snippet_kind\": \"key-source\",\n            \"source_id\": \"source-1379db2c3f3d\",\n            \"start_line\": 29,\n            \"symbol_ids\": [\n              \"symbol-0cf1c953da24\"\n            ]\n          }\n        ],\n        \"title\": \"builder-vite 研究包\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page_id\": \"page-7ce9e9d45885\",\n    \"page_type\": \"topic\",\n    \"scope\": \"topic:module-capability:module-f183267d666d-plugin\",\n    \"summary_inputs\": [\n      \"主题摘要：该主题聚焦 `builder-vite` 模块中的扩展机制能力，相关热点包括 build -> commonConfig、build -> createViteLogger。\",\